# DEC PDP-8 Simple Addition Test Program
# Address | Octal | Hex  | Instruction/Data
# --------|-------|------|-----------------
# 000     | 7200  | E00  | CLA CLL (Clear Accumulator and Link)
# 001     | 1005  | 205  | TAD 005 (Two's complement add value at address 005)
# 002     | 1006  | 206  | TAD 006 (Two's complement add value at address 006)
# 003     | 3007  | 607  | DCA 007 (Deposit Accumulator to address 007 and clear AC)
# 004     | 7402  | F02  | HLT (Halt)
# 005     | 0005  | 005  | Data: 5
# 006     | 0015  | 00D  | Data: 13
# 007     | 0000  | 000  | Data: 0 (Result target, should become 18 = 0x12)

E00
205
206
607
